  <History Date="18-07-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="02-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Updated to spec" />
  <History Date="19-11-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited corrected Gobo 2 Func" />
  <History Date="19-11-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited corrected iris locate to 0%" />
  <History Date="28-01-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Corrected Gobo function channels." />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information. Added RDM Fixture information. Added RDM Mode information." />
  <History Date="30-06-14" Author="stephen harris" Comment="Edited to update gobo rot resolution so 16bit rather than 0-255 on wheels" />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added physical pan/tilt limits.  Added raw func to colour func." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed pulse shutter palettes to random to match associated functions." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed gobo rot raw range to 65535." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution for gobo spin, shutter strobe, zoom, focus, effect and prism rot ranges." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed gobo shake and scroll functions from fixed to percentage." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="08-11-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Inverted zoom" />
  <History Date="07-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="07-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches.  Added default gobo names.  Changed colour index ranges to ensure full field." />
  <History Date="07-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour function index.  Corrected gobo rot 16bit values.  Revised control functions." />
  <History Date="07-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing macros." />
